            <div class="site-body">
	<div class="responsive-container">
		<div class="text-carousel swiper-container swiper-container-vertical swiper-container-fade">
			<div class="swiper-wrapper" style="transition-duration: 0ms;">
				<div data-section="building" data-id="0" data-swiping="both" class="swiper-slide text-section swiper-slide-prev" style="height: 944px; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px); transition-duration: 0ms;">
					<div class="text-center title-section">
                        <h5 class="section-title-header">Building</h5>
					</div>

					<div class="text-para center">
						<div class="body-copy sans">The icons of the New York skyline have a new companion.<span class="visible-xs-inline visible-sm-inline visible-md-inline visible-xl-block"></span>  DESIGNED BY RAFAEL VIÑOLY AND RISING <span class="visible-xs-inline visible-sm-inline visible-md-inline visible-xl-block"></span>  1,396 FEET ABOVE PARK AVENUE BETWEEN <span class="visible-xs-inline visible-sm-inline visible-md-inline visible-xl-block"></span>  56TH AND 57TH STREETS, 432 PARK AVENUE <span class="visible-xs-inline visible-sm-inline visible-md-inline visible-xl-block"></span>   IS THE TALLEST RESIDENTIAL TOWER <span class="visible-xs-inline visible-sm-inline visible-md-inline visible-xl-block"></span>  IN THE WESTERN HEMISPHERE. <span class="visible-xs-inline visible-sm-inline visible-md-inline visible-xl-block"></span>  <br><br> Immediate occupancy &nbsp;
</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div data-section="interiors" data-id="0" data-swiping="both" class="swiper-slide text-section swiper-slide-active" style="height: 944px; opacity: 1; transform: translate3d(0px, -944px, 0px); transition-duration: 0ms;">
					<div class="text-center title-section">
                        <h5 class="section-title-header">Interiors</h5>
					</div>

					<div class="text-para center">
							<h1 class="text-section-title">Residential Interiors</h1>
						<div class="body-copy ">An extraordinary creative collaboration <span class="visible-xs-inline visible-sm-inline visible-md-inline visible-xl-block"></span> has resulted in a new landmark for the <span class="visible-xs-inline visible-sm-inline visible-md-inline visible-xl-block"></span> world’s greatest city. Melding Palladian-proportioned <span class="visible-xs-inline visible-sm-inline visible-md-inline visible-xl-block"></span> rooms with the highest engineering technology, <span class="visible-xs-inline visible-sm-inline visible-md-inline visible-xl-block"></span> honest materials, and versatile planning, <span class="visible-xs-inline visible-sm-inline visible-md-inline visible-xl-block"></span> 432 Park Avenue has reinvented the classic <span class="visible-xs-inline visible-sm-inline visible-md-inline visible-xl-block"></span> Park Avenue residence for the 21st&nbsp;century.
</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div data-section="interiors" data-id="5" data-swiping="text" class="swiper-slide text-section swiper-slide-next" style="height: 944px; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, -1888px, 0px); transition-duration: 0ms;">
					<div class="text-center title-section">
                        <h5 class="section-title-header">Interiors</h5>
					</div>

					<div class="text-para center">
							<h1 class="text-section-title"><span class="bulleted-list">RESIDENCE FEATURES</span></h1>
						<div class="body-copy "><ul>
  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>15'-6" floor-to-floor height throughout with a finished ceiling to 12'-6"</span></li> 

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>10'x10' insulated glass windows</span></li> 

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>8'-9" doors</span></li> 

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Solid oak flooring, 2-3/8" wide</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Custom eat-in kitchen</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Custom hardware and fittings</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Central heating and air conditioning</span></li> 

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Motorized window shades</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Master bedroom suite with double bathrooms and dressing room*</span></li> 

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Service entrances*</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Private elevator landing*</span></li> 

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Utility room with full-size washer and dryer</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list diff">*In select&nbsp;residences</li>
</ul>
</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div data-section="interiors" data-id="12" data-swiping="both" class="swiper-slide text-section" style="height: 944px; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, -2832px, 0px); transition-duration: 0ms;">
					<div class="text-center title-section">
                        <h5 class="section-title-header">Interiors</h5>
					</div>

					<div class="text-para center">
							<h1 class="text-section-title">KITCHENS</h1>
						<div class="body-copy ">From morning coffee at the window-framed breakfast bar to seamless formal entertaining, 432 Park Avenue’s kitchens elevate daily life. Interior architect Deborah Berke has conceived a sunlight-flooded room whose expansive size and open configuration accommodate a family gathering or catering by the exclusive restaurant. Marble floors and countertops, white-lacquer and oak cabinetry, and Miele appliances infuse functionality with&nbsp;sumptuousness.
</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div data-section="interiors" data-id="13" data-swiping="text" class="swiper-slide text-section" style="height: 944px; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, -3776px, 0px); transition-duration: 0ms;">
					<div class="text-center title-section">
                        <h5 class="section-title-header">Interiors</h5>
					</div>

					<div class="text-para center">
							<h1 class="text-section-title"><span class="bulleted-list">KITCHEN FEATURES</span></h1>
						<div class="body-copy "><ul>
  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Marble floor and countertops</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>White lacquer and natural oak cabinetry</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Custom cove and under-counter lighting</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Stainless steel backsplash and toe kick</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Miele stainless steel appliances</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Miele wine cooler</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Franke double sinks</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Dornbracht polished-chrome fixtures</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Double dishwashers</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Built-in espresso maker*</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list diff">*In select&nbsp;residences</li>
</ul>
</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div data-section="interiors" data-id="16" data-swiping="both" class="swiper-slide text-section" style="height: 944px; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, -4720px, 0px); transition-duration: 0ms;">
					<div class="text-center title-section">
                        <h5 class="section-title-header">Interiors</h5>
					</div>

					<div class="text-para center">
							<h1 class="text-section-title">Baths</h1>
						<div class="body-copy ">For the master baths at 432 Park Avenue, Deborah Berke celebrates the vistas stretching across the New York skyline to the Atlantic Ocean by placing freestanding soaking tubs within the tower’s signature 10-foot square windows. Marble surfaces, radiant-heated floors, and Dornbracht polished-chrome fittings complete the&nbsp;composition.
</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div data-section="interiors" data-id="17" data-swiping="text" class="swiper-slide text-section" style="height: 944px; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, -5664px, 0px); transition-duration: 0ms;">
					<div class="text-center title-section">
                        <h5 class="section-title-header">Interiors</h5>
					</div>

					<div class="text-para center">
							<h1 class="text-section-title"><span class="bulleted-list">BATH FEATURES</span></h1>
						<div class="body-copy "><ul>
  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Marble floors and walls</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Solid cubic-marble vanities</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>22" oval-shaped sinks</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Custom under-counter cabinets</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Custom medicine cabinets</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Custom lay lights</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Freestanding soaking tub</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Radiant heated floors</span></li>

  <li class="bulleted-list"><span>Dornbracht polished chrome bath&nbsp;fittings</span></li>
</ul>
</div>
					</div>
				</div>
                <div data-section="end" data-swiping="text" class="text-section swiper-slide" data-id="8" style="height: 944px; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, -6608px, 0px); transition-duration: 0ms;">
                    <!--nothing here-->
